he title, and click `Publish`.\\\\\\\\n    *   Community Documents\\\\\\\\n    *   Meeting Minutes\\\\\\\\n    *   Financial Reports\\\\\\\\n    *   Event Calendar\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Part 5: Basic Configuration**\\\\\\\\n13. Directive: Set the \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" page as the website's front page. Navigate to `Settings` -> `Reading`. Under \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Your homepage displays\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", select \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"A static page\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". From the \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Homepage\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dropdown, select \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". Click `Save Changes`.\\\\\\\\n14. Directive: Create a primary navigation menu. Navigate to `Appearance` -> `Menus`. Enter `Main Menu` as the menu name and click `Create Menu`.\\\\\\\\n15. Directive: From the \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Pages\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" box on the left, check the boxes for `Home`, `About Us`, `News & Updates`, `Contact Us`, and `Resident Portal`. Click `Add to Menu`.\\\\\\\\n16. Directive: Under \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Menu Settings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" at the bottom, check the box for \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Primary Menu\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". Click `Save Menu`.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Part 6: User Roles and Content Restriction**\\\\\\\\n17. Directive: Create a \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Resident\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" user role. Navigate to `Ultimate Member` -> `User Roles`. Click `Add New`. Set the \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Role Title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" to `Resident` and click `Create Role`.\\\\\\\\n18. Directive: Restrict access to private pages. Navigate to `Pages` -> `All Pages`. For each private page (`Community Documents`, `Meeting Minutes`, `Financial Reports`, `Event Calendar`), hover over the page title, click `Edit`, and find the \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ultimate Member\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" box at the bottom of the editor.\\\\\\\\n19. Directive: In the \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ultimate Member\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" box, select \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Restrict access to this post?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\". In the section that appears, check the box next to \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Logged in users\\\\\