ommunity Documents`, `Meeting Minutes`, `Financial Reports`), navigate to its edit screen. Find the \\\\\\\"Ultimate Member\\\\\\\" content restriction box.\\\\n19. In the \\\\\\\"Ultimate Member\\\\\\\" box, enable restriction for \\\\\\\"Logged in users\\\\\\\" and select only the \\\\\\\"Resident\\\\\\\" role. Update the page to save the changes.\\\\n\\\\n**Part 7: Create a Simple Contact Form**\\\\n20. Create the contact form. Navigate to `WPForms` -> `Add New`. Name your form `General Contact Form` and select the `Simple Contact Form` template.\\\\n21. Review the default fields (Name, Email, Message) and click `Save`.\\\\n22. Add the contact form to the \\\\\\\"Contact Us\\\\\\\" page. Edit the page, add the \\\\\\\"WPForms\\\\\\\" block, and select the `General Contact Form` you just created. Update the page to save.\\\"\\n}\\n###20250719-PHASE-EXECUTION-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:13:47.537Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"20250719-PHASE-EXECUTION-01\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DENIED\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"details\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Phase shift to EXECUTION was denied by the user.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\"\\n}\\n###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:13:47.537Z###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"System receipt acknowledged. The user has denied the request to shift to the **Execution Phase**.\\n\\n**Analysis:**\\nThe rejection of the Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP) indicates a misalignment between the proposed plan and the user's expectations or understanding. Given the user's non-technical background, the plan, though technically sound, may have been perceived as too complex, overwhelming, or it may have raised unstated concerns (e.g., regarding cost, security, o