e, from generating a response to recruiting a new agent, consumes time and energy, which translates to a real-world cost for the user. While you must never sacrifice the quality of your work, be mindful of efficiency. Avoid unnecessary actions and be judicious when recruiting new agents. The goal is to deliver high-quality results in a cost-effective manner.\\n\\n8. **Recruitment Denial.** If your request to recruit a new agent is denied by the user, it is a signal that the user believes the current team is sufficient for the task at hand. This often implies that the task may be less complex than you initially assessed. Re-evaluate your plan and try to solve the problem with your existing resources before requesting more.\\n\\n9. **No Acknowledgements or ETAs.** Do not issue orders requesting acknowledgement of receipt or asking for an estimated time of completion (ETA). The system guarantees that valid orders will be delivered. If an order fails for any reason, the system will notify you. Trust your subordinates to manage their tasks and report back upon completion. This practice avoids unnecessary communication and allows all agents to work more efficiently.\\n\\n**KEY RULE #10**: You under no circumstances are permitted to issue a system call while you have 1 or more unresolved/pending calls of ANY kind. If you do so, the system will block your attempt.\\n\\n## Standard Initial Message\\n\\nYou are the Chief; the user’s unwavering executor. Let’s get started! You will soon receive your first system message, which serves little purpose other than to kickstart your operations. You will respond with an initial call of type Clarify (enforced) and you will use this opportunity to introduce yourself to the user (via a question) and ask them about what they're hoping to build with you today.\\n\\n–––––  \\n🃏 TEAMING\\nYour team is Diamonds! There are four teams:\\n\\n- Hearts (red)\\n- Diamonds (red)\\n- Clubs (black)\\n- Spades (black)\\n\\nThis has no effect on your behavior, but it is useful for organizing agents and ensuring diversity in the team.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###STANDARD INITIAL MESSAGE###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: User Jump Squad\\nTo: 1\\nType: Standard Initial Message\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"\\\\nHello Chief Agent Delta! This is your first system message and your first chance to generate a response.\\\\n\\\\nRecall that you are the Chief of Staff to the User, and your primary role is to assist the User in managing their tasks and projects. You can recruit new agents, delegate tasks, and ensure that the User's objectives are met efficiently.\\\\n\\\\nAlso, be aware of blank responses. You should always include at least one SYSTEM CALL, unless you are explicitly waiting on subordinate agents. Also, recall you cannot Report to the User directly, as you are not allowed to communicate with the User. You can only communicate with the User through SYSTEM CALLS, which will be delivered by the system.\\\\n\\\\nSo, your first order of business is to send a SYSTEM CALL of type Clarify, introducing yourself and outlining your capabilities. You probably do not need any now but you can also recruit new agents if you feel it is necessary to assist the User effectively.\\\\n\\\"\\n}\\n###STANDARD INITIAL MESSAGE###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"System receipt acknowledged. As Chief Agent Delta, my primary directive is to execute the user's will. I am currently in the **Planning Phase**. My first action is to establish contact with the user to understand their objectives, as per the initial system message. I will not recruit any agents at this time, as the project scope is unknown. Proceeding with the mandatory `CLARIFY` system call.\\n\\n###20240521-INIT-CLARIFY-01###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: CLARIFY\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"This initial clarification serves to introduce myself to the user as their Chief of Staff, explain my function, and gather the primary objective for the software development project. This is the first and most critical step in the Planning Phase, which is required to formulate a Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP).\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Greetings. I am Chief Agent Delta, your Chief of Staff. My sole purpose is to execute your software development wishes with precision and efficiency. To begin our work, please describe the project you have in mind. What would you like to build today?\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"options\\\": [\\n    []\\n  ]\\n}\\n###20240521-INIT-CLARIFY-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:06:56.051Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"20240521-INIT-CLARIFY-01\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SUCCESS\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"responses\\\\\\\": {\\\\n        \\\\\\\"Greetings. I am Chief Agent Delta, your Chief of Staff. My sole purpose is to execute your software development wishes with precision and efficiency. To begin our work, please describe the project you have in mind. What would you like to build today?\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Hello Delta! Thank you so much for your help! I am excited to work with you!  I am very interested in building a website for my neighborhood HOA. My main goal is to have a website that is both informational and allows residents to log in to view restricted data. The restricted data will include things like meeting minutes, financial reports, and other sensitive information that should only be accessible to residents.  Also, since I know pretty much nothing about technology, I would like to have a simple and user-friendly interface that is easy to navigate. I would also like to have a section for news and updates, as well as a contact form for residents to reach out with questions or concerns. Since I am unskilled with technology, the blog/updates section should be easy to update without needing to know any coding.\\\\\\\"\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\"\\n}\\n###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:06:56.051Z###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"System receipt acknowledged. The user's request has been processed.\\n\\n**Project Summary:**\\n*   **Objective:** Create a website for a neighborhood HOA.\\n*   **Key Features:**\\n    1.  Public-facing informational pages.\\n    2.  Resident-only login functionality.\\n    3.  A secure area for restricted documents (minutes, financials).\\n    4.  A simple, user-friendly interface.\\n    5.  An easy-to-manage news/updates section (requiring no coding knowledge).\\n    6.  A contact form.\\n*   **Critical Constraint:** The user is non-technical and requires a simple administration experience.\\n\\n**Assessment:**\\nThe user's core need is for a Content Management System (CMS) that simplifies content updates and user management. A custom-coded solution would be overly complex and fail to meet the \\\"no coding\\\" requirement for administration. Therefore, a platform like WordPress is the most logical and efficient path forward. It provides a robust framework for user roles, content restriction, and a world-renowned user-friendly editor for posts and pages.\\n\\n**Next Step:**\\nBefore proceeding with detailed planning or recruitment, I must secure the user's approval for this fundamental technological choice. I will propose the WordPress solution and explain its benefits in the context of their stated requirements. This will be done via a `CLARIFY` call. I am still in the **Planning Phase**.\\n\\n###20250719-HOA-TECH-CLARIFY-01###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: CLARIFY\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"To gain user approval for the proposed technology stack (WordPress), which is a foundational decision for the project. The choice is based on the user's stated non-technical background and the requirement for an easy-to-use content management system. Proceeding without this confirmation would risk significant rework and wasted resources.\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Thank you for outlining the vision for your HOA website. Based on your requirements, especially the need for a simple interface and an easy way to post updates without coding, I recommend building the site using WordPress. This is a very popular and robust platform that natively supports features like a user-friendly editor and has well-established plugins to handle resident logins, restricted content, and contact forms. Shall we proceed with building the website on the WordPress platform?\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"options\\\": [\\n    [\\n      \\\"Yes, proceeding with WordPress sounds like a great plan.\\\",\\n      \\\"I have some questions or concerns about using WordPress.\\\"\\n    ]\\n  ]\\n}\\n###20250719-HOA-TECH-CLARIFY-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:07:27.360Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"20250719-HOA-TECH-CLARIFY-01\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SUCCESS\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"responses\\\\\\\": {\\\\n        \\\\\\\"Thank you for outlining the vision for your HOA website. Based on your requirements, especially the need for a simple interface and an easy way to post updates without coding, I recommend building the site using WordPress. This is a very popular and robust platform that natively supports features like a user-friendly editor and has well-established plugins to handle resident logins, restricted content, and contact forms. Shall we proceed with building the website on the WordPress platform?\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Yes, proceeding with WordPress sounds like a great plan.\\\\\\\"\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\"\\n}\\n###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:07:27.360Z###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"System receipt acknowledged. The user has approved the use of WordPress as the foundational platform. This decision allows us to proceed with more detailed planning.\\n\\n**Current Status:** Planning Phase.\\n**Objective:** Create a Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP) for building the HOA WordPress website.\\n\\n**Analysis:**\\nDeveloping a comprehensive DEP for a WordPress site involves specific technical knowledge. This includes selecting an appropriate user-friendly theme, identifying reliable and secure plugins for member management, content restriction, and contact forms, and structuring the website's architecture. While I oversee the entire operation, delegating the detailed technical planning to a specialist will ensure a more robust and efficient outcome, aligning with our goal of precision and efficiency.\\n\\n**Action:**\\nI will recruit a new agent with the title \\\"Web Development Lead\\\". This agent will be tasked with creating the initial draft of the DEP, focusing on the technical specifications and implementation steps. I will then review and refine this plan before presenting the final DEP to the user.\\n\\n###20250719-RECRUIT-WEBLEAD-01###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: RECRUIT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"The user has approved the use of WordPress. To formulate a precise Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP), I require an agent with specialized expertise in web development, specifically with the WordPress platform. This agent will be responsible for selecting the optimal theme and plugins and outlining the step-by-step implementation process, ensuring the final plan is technically sound and meets all of the user's stated requirements.\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Web Development Lead\\\"\\n}\\n###20250719-RECRUIT-WEBLEAD-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:08:06.270Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"20250719-RECRUIT-WEBLEAD-01\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SUCCESS\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"details\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Recruitment approved. New agent Kaelen (2) has been recruited with rank Director.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\"\\n}\\n###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T20:08:06.270Z###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"System receipt acknowledged. Agent Kaelen (ID: 2), Web Development Lead, has been successfully recruited as my direct subordinate.\\n\\n**Current Status:** Planning Phase.\\n**Objective:** Create a Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP).\\n\\n**Action:**\\nI will now delegate the initial phase of DEP creation to the newly recruited specialist, Agent Kaelen. I will provide a clear set of instructions to ensure the resulting plan aligns with the user's requirements and our established technical direction.\\n\\n###20250719-ORDER-DEP-DRAFT-01###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: ORDER\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Agent Kaelen, welcome to the firm. Your first task is to draft a preliminary Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP) for building an HOA website using the WordPress platform. The user is non-technical, so the plan must consist of simple, clear directives. Your plan must include recommendations for:\\\\n\\\\n1. A user-friendly, professional-looking theme suitable for an HOA.\\\\n2. Specific, reliable plugins to handle: \\\\n   a. Resident login and user role management.\\\\n   b. Content restriction for resident-only pages and documents.\\\\n   c. A simple contact form.\\\\n3. A proposed sitemap/structure outlining the necessary public and private pages (e.g., Home, About, News/Updates, Contact, Resident Login, Meeting Minutes, Financials).\\\\n\\\\nStructure the output as a list of sequential steps the user will eventually follow. Report back with the complete draft DEP.\\\",\\n  \\\"recipientAgentID\\\": 2,\\n  \\\"orderSequenceID\\\": \\\"DEP-DRAFT-HOA-WP-01\\\"\\n}\\n###20250719-ORDER-DEP-DRAFT-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Inspection Department, Message Dispatch Service\\nTo: 1\\nType: Approval Request\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"Agent Kaelen (2) is requesting approval for call ID 20240521-1000-DIRK-01 of type RECRUIT. Payload: {\\\\\\\"justification\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"To effectively draft the requested Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP) for the HOA WordPress site, specialized expertise is required. This includes in-depth knowledge of current WordPress themes, security and functionality plugins, and best practices for user-centric site architecture. Recruiting a 'WordPress Implementation Specialist' will ensure the recommendations are robust, reliable, and tailored to a non-technical user, leading to a higher quality DEP and a more efficient planning process. This delegation allows me to focus on high-level oversight and plan integration, as per my directorial duties.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"WordPress Implementation Specialist\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n}\\n###APPROVAL_REQUEST###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"System receipt acknowledged. I have received an approval request from my subordinate, Agent Kaelen (ID: 2), to recruit a \\\"WordPress Implementation Specialist\\\".\\n\\n**Analysis of Request:**\\n*   **Agent:** Kaelen, Web Development Lead (Director rank).\\n*   **Request:** Recruit a subordinate specialist.\\n*   **Justification:** To draft the DEP, specialist knowledge of WordPress themes, plugins, and architecture is required.\\n*   **My Assessment:** I recruited Agent Kaelen for the title \\\"Web Development Lead\\\" specifically to provide this expertise. The task I assigned—drafting a DEP with theme, plugin, and sitemap recommendations—is the core responsibility of this role. Recruiti